"""Offline checks for the security-audit-for-saas overlay scripts.

Usage: check.py SCRIPTS_DIR FIXTURES_DIR

Prints one line per check and exits 1 if any failed. Nothing here touches the
network: OSV is replaced at the HTTP-post layer (so the real batching, paging and
filtering code runs), the one live-network check aims at a closed local port, and
endoflife.date is read from FIXTURES_DIR/eol-data via --data.
"""
